  "While traveling around =player.terrain.t=, =name= discovered =player.landmark.nearest=. There =player.subjective= befriended fungi and contracted =object.name= on =player.their= =part.ordinalName=.": "在 =player.terrain.t= 一带旅行时，=name= 发现了 =player.landmark.nearest=。在那里，=player.subjective= 与真菌交好，=player.their= =part.ordinalName= 感染了 =object.name=。",
  "Woe to the scoundrels and dastards who conspired to have =name= contract the rotting tongue!": "愿那些密谋让 =name= 染上烂舌病的恶棍与懦夫遭殃！",
  "Near the location of Golgotha, =name= was captured by bandits. =player.Subjective= languished in captivity for =captivityTime= years, eventually contracting glotrot before escaping to =player.terrain.t=.": "在各各他附近，=name= 被土匪俘虏。=player.Subjective= 被囚禁了 =captivityTime= 年，最终染上烂舌病，随后逃往 =player.terrain.t=。",
  "{{glotrot|glotrot}}": "{{glotrot|烂舌病}}",
  "Remember the =day= of =month=, in the year of =year=, when through sheer strength of will =name= regrew =player.their= tongue.": "铭记 =year= 年 =month= 月 =day= 日，=name= 凭借纯粹的意志力让 =player.their= 舌头重新长出。",
  "On =day= of =month=, in the year of =year=, =name= took a vow of silence and removed =player.their= own tongue.": "=year= 年 =month= 月 =day= 日，=name= 立下沉默誓言，割掉了 =player.their= 舌头。",
  "Woe to the scoundrels and dastards who conspired to have =name= contract Stiff Leg!": "愿那些密谋让 =name= 染上僵腿病的恶棍与懦夫遭殃！",
  "Some time in =year=, =name= came upon the bandits who had captured =player.objective= and let =player.objective= languish in captivity until =player.subjective= contracted ironshank. =name= murdered their leader =spice:elements.$domain.murdermethods.!random= and cured =player.reflexive= of the disease.": "=year= 年的某个时候，=name= 遇到了曾俘虏 =player.objective=、并将 =player.objective= 关押至 =player.subjective= 染上铁胫病的土匪。=name= =spice:elements.$domain.murdermethods.!random= 杀死了他们的首领，并治好了 =player.reflexive= 的病。",
  "Woe to the scoundrels and dastards who conspired to have =name= contract univision!": "愿那些密谋让 =name= 染上独视症的恶棍与懦夫遭殃！",
