  "You maintain your balance and shake the eel off.": "你保持住平衡，将鳗鱼甩掉。",
  "=subject.Does:spot= a sewage eel =object.to.the.direction=!": "=subject.Does:spot= 发现一条污水鳗 =object.to.the.direction=！",
  "=subject.Does:resist= being blown back by =object.the.name=.": "=subject.Does:resist= 抵住了 =object.the.name= 的吹袭。",
  "=subject.Does:are= blown back by =object.the.name=.": "=subject.Does:are= 被 =object.the.name= 吹退。",
  "=subject.Does:are= blown forcefully back by =object.the.name=.": "=subject.Does:are= 被 =object.the.name= 猛地吹退。",
  "=subject.Does:are= blown into the air by =object.the.name=!": "=subject.Does:are= 被 =object.the.name= 吹上半空！",
  "=subject.Does:grab= =object.the.name= and holds you in place.": "=subject.Does:grab= 抓住 =object.the.name=，将你固定在原地。",
  "=subject.Does:start= to fizz hungrily.": "=subject.Does:start= 饥渴地冒起泡来。",
  "You discovered the Hydropon.": "你发现了水培园。",
  "=spice:commonPhrases.intrepid.!random|capitalize= =name= discovered the Hydropon.": "=spice:commonPhrases.intrepid.!random|capitalize= =name= 发现了水培园。",
  "Acting against labor laws restricting the rights of newly sentient plant-people, =name= led an army to the gates of the Hydropon. =player.They= =spice:commonPhrases.liberated.!random= its citizens, and in =player.their= honor they =spice:history.gospels.Celebration.LateSultanate.!random=.": "为反抗限制新获意识的植物人权利的劳动法，=name= 率军抵达水培园的大门。=player.They= =spice:commonPhrases.liberated.!random= 那里的居民；为纪念 =player.their=，他们 =spice:history.gospels.Celebration.LateSultanate.!random=。",
  "Hydropon": "水培园",
  "It's the hydropon.": "这是水培园。",
  "=location.text|titleCaseWithArticle": "=location.text|titleCaseWithArticle",
  "You discover =locName=!": "你发现了 =locName=！",
  "You discovered =locName=.": "你发现了 =locName=。",
  "=spice:commonPhrases.intrepid.!random|capitalize= =name= discovered =locName=, once thought lost to the sands of time.": "=spice:commonPhrases.intrepid.!random|capitalize= =name= 发现了曾被认为消失在时间之沙中的 =locName=。",
  "In =year=, =name= won a decisive victory against the combined force of =hatedFaction.the.name= from =subject.terrain.t= at the bloody Battle of =locName=.": "=year= 年，=name= 在血腥的 =locName= 之战中，对来自 =subject.terrain.t= 的 =hatedFaction.the.name= 联军取得了决定性胜利。",
  "You traveled to =locName=!": "你来到了 =locName=！",
  "You traveled to =locName=.": "你来到了 =locName=。",
  "The air =subject.generalDirectionIfAny= starts to shimmer with heat!": "空气 =subject.generalDirectionIfAny= 开始因热浪而扭曲！",
  "The air =subject.generalDirectionIfAny= ceases shimmering with heat.": "空气 =subject.generalDirectionIfAny= 不再因热浪而扭曲。",
  "=subject.Does:collapse= under the pressure of normality.": "=subject.Does:collapse= 在常态压力下崩溃。",
  "Two =subject.pluralize= come into contact and both explode!": "两个 =subject.pluralize= 相互接触，一同爆炸！",
  "=subject.Does:come= into contact with =object.the.name= and both explode!": "=subject.Does:come= 与 =object.the.name= 接触，一同爆炸！",
  "=subject.The.name= =subject.directionIfAny= =subject.verb:are= sucked into =object.a.name=!": "=subject.The.name= =subject.directionIfAny= =subject.verb:are= 被吸入 =object.a.name=！",
  "Your companion, =subject.the.name=, =subject.verb:have= been sucked into =object.the.name= =subject.to.the.direction=!": "你的同伴 =subject.the.name=，=subject.verb:have= 被吸入 =object.the.name= =subject.to.the.direction=！",
  "=subject.Does:climb= through =object.the.name= =object.to.the.direction=!": "=subject.Does:climb= 穿过 =object.the.name= =object.to.the.direction=！",
  "=subject.Does:fall= through =object.the.name= =object.to.the.direction=!": "=subject.Does:fall= 穿过 =object.the.name= =object.to.the.direction=！",
  "[=repAmount.signed|color:C= reputation]": "[声望 =repAmount.signed|color:C=]",
  "You have no artifacts to offer that are not important.": "你没有可以献出的非重要古物。",
  "You have no artifacts to offer.": "你没有可以献出的古物。",
  "Choose artifacts to throw down the well.": "选择要投入井中的古物。",
  "throw": "投掷",
  "down": "向下",
  "=subject.Does:throw= =items.andList:noSecondPerson= down =object.the.name=.": "=subject.Does:throw= 将 =items.andList:noSecondPerson= 投入 =object.the.name=。",
  "<unknown name>": "<未知名称>",
  "ruined mural of =sultanName|withCognomen#cognomen=": "=sultanName|withCognomen#cognomen=的残破壁画",
  "The tomb mural depicts a significant event from the life of the ancient sultan =sultanName|withCognomen#cognomen=, but it's no longer legible.": "陵墓壁画描绘了古代苏丹 =sultanName|withCognomen#cognomen= 一生中的重大事件，但如今已无法辨认。",
  "ruined mural slate": "残破壁画石板",
  "blank mural slate": "空白壁画石板",
  "mural of =sultanName|withCognomen#cognomen=": "=sultanName|withCognomen#cognomen=的壁画",
  "The tomb mural depicts a significant event from the life of the ancient sultan =sultanName|withCognomen#cognomen=:\n\n=tombInscription=": "陵墓壁画描绘了古代苏丹 =sultanName|withCognomen#cognomen= 一生中的重大事件：\n\n=tombInscription=",
  "Herododicus says '{{W|I'm finished, Moloch! Praise =name= Resheph, all who canter in this House!}}": "希罗多狄库斯说：“{{W|我完成了，摩洛克！赞美 =name= 雷谢夫，愿这殿中奔行的众生齐声赞颂！}}",
  "Herododicus says '{{W|I'm done!}}": "希罗多狄库斯说：“{{W|我完成了！}}",
  "On the =day= of =month=, =name= died peacefully and was laid to rest in the Tomb of Sultans.": "=month= 月 =day= 日，=name= 安详离世，长眠于苏丹之墓。",
  "The tomb mural depicts a significant event from the life of the sultan =name|withCognomen#cognomen=:\n\n=tombInscription=": "陵墓壁画描绘了苏丹 =name|withCognomen#cognomen= 一生中的重大事件：\n\n=tombInscription=",
  "=terrainFragment|capitalize= and =terrainFragment2=, here =spice:commonPhrases.stretches.!random= the ancient =spice.entity:governmentType= where =spice:history.regions.organizingPrinciple.$organizingPrinciple.entity@organizingPrincipleType.thingsTheyDid.!random=.": "=terrainFragment|capitalize= 与 =terrainFragment2=，此处 =spice:commonPhrases.stretches.!random= 古老的 =spice.entity:governmentType=，在那里 =spice:history.regions.organizingPrinciple.$organizingPrinciple.entity@organizingPrincipleType.thingsTheyDid.!random=。",
  "=spice:history.regions.organizingPrinciple.$organizingPrinciple.entity@organizingPrincipleType.thingsTheyDid.!random|capitalize= in the =spice:commonPhrases.lost.!random= =spice.entity:governmentType= whose ruins lie =terrainFragment=.": "=spice:history.regions.organizingPrinciple.$organizingPrinciple.entity@organizingPrincipleType.thingsTheyDid.!random|capitalize= 于 =spice:commonPhrases.lost.!random= 的 =spice.entity:governmentType=，其废墟位于 =terrainFragment=。",
  "=newName|title": "=newName|title",
  "You visited the historic site of =regionName=.": "你造访了历史遗址 =regionName=。",
  "=spice:commonPhrases.intrepid.!random|capitalize= =name= discovered =regionName=, once thought lost to the sands of time.": "=spice:commonPhrases.intrepid.!random|capitalize= =name= 发现了曾被认为消失在时间之沙中的 =regionName=。",
  "Acting against the enfranchisement of =faction.formattedName=, =name= led an army to the historic site of =regionName=. =name= =spice:commonPhrases.liberated.!random= its citizens, and in =player.their= honor they =spice:history.gospels.Celebration.LateSultanate.!random=.": "为反抗赋予 =faction.formattedName= 公民权，=name= 率军来到历史遗址 =regionName=。=name= =spice:commonPhrases.liberated.!random= 那里的居民；为纪念 =player.their=，他们 =spice:history.gospels.Celebration.LateSultanate.!random=。",
  "Notes:": "笔记：",
  "You visited the village of =villageName=.": "你造访了村庄 =villageName=。",
  "In the month of =month= of =year= AR, =name= founded the village of =villageName= to =spice:history.gospels.HumblePractice.LateSultanate.!random=.": "雷谢夫纪元 =year= 年 =month= 月，=name= 建立了 =villageName= 村，意在 =spice:history.gospels.HumblePractice.LateSultanate.!random=。",
  "Acting against the prohibition on the practice of =spice:elements.$domain.practices.!random=, =name= led an army to the gates of =villageName=. =name= =spice:commonPhrases.liberated.!random= its citizens, and in =player.their= honor they =spice:history.gospels.Celebration.LateSultanate.!random=.": "为反抗对 =spice:elements.$domain.practices.!random= 实践的禁令，=name= 率军抵达 =villageName= 村的大门。=name= =spice:commonPhrases.liberated.!random= 那里的居民；为纪念 =player.their=，他们 =spice:history.gospels.Celebration.LateSultanate.!random=。",
  "name|title": "name|title",
  "build =object.pluralize:direct=": "建造 =object.pluralize:direct=",
  "mod items with the =mods.andList= =mods.pluralize:mod=": "用 =mods.andList= =mods.pluralize:mod= 改装物品",
  "It's been live for over a year.": "它已经持续广播一年多了。",
  "A tinker must have detected it and then recorded it onto the data disk you brought us. However, we've known about since it went live over a year ago.": "一定是某位工匠侦测到了信号，并把它记录在你带来的数据盘上。不过，我们从它一年多前开始广播时就知道了。",
  "[{{R|!!! ERROR: POWER SYSTEMS HAVE FAILED !!!}}]": "[{{R|！！！错误：供电系统已失效！！！}}]",
  "[{{W|!!! WARNING: INSUFFICIENT POWER !!!}}]": "[{{W|！！！警告：电力不足！！！}}]",
  "Available power: =available= amps": "可用电力：=available= 安培",
  "The ceiling collapses and rocks come pouring in!": "天花板坍塌，岩石倾泻而下！",
  "The whole compound rumbles around you.": "整座建筑在你周围隆隆震动。",
  "The walls creak, loose objects skid about, and dust is stirred up in iridescent clouds.": "墙壁吱呀作响，零散的物品四处滑动，扬起的尘埃形成虹彩云团。",
  "Otho yells, '{{W|=name=! Come back here!}}'": "奥索喊道：“{{W|=name=！回来！}}”",
  "=name=, I've assessed the losses we suffered in the attack.": "=name=，我已经评估了我们在袭击中遭受的损失。",
  "First and foremost, let us lament the =killedList.pluralize:death= of our =killedList.pluralize:friend=: =killedList.andList:noSerial=. The loss to us is incalculable.\n\nBeyond that,": "首先，让我们哀悼 =killedList.pluralize:death= 的 =killedList.pluralize:friend=：=killedList.andList:noSerial=。这对我们是无法估量的损失。\n\n此外，",
  "=chromelings.cardinal.no|initCap.if#noKilled= =chromelings.pluralize:robot= perished, =books.cardinal.no= =books.pluralize:book was:books were= burned, =bookshelves.cardinal.no= =bookshelves.pluralize:bookshelf was:bookshelves were= destroyed, =crops.cardinal.no= =crops.pluralize:crop was:crops were= ruined, =gadgets.cardinal.no= =gadgets.pluralize:gadget was:gadgets were= shattered, and =furniture.cardinal.no= =furniture.pluralize:piece= of furniture =furniture.pluralize:was:were= destroyed.": "=chromelings.cardinal.no|initCap.if#noKilled= =chromelings.pluralize:robot= 被摧毁，=books.cardinal.no= =books.pluralize:book was:books were= 被焚毁，=bookshelves.cardinal.no= =bookshelves.pluralize:bookshelf was:bookshelves were= 被毁坏，=crops.cardinal.no= =crops.pluralize:crop was:crops were= 遭到破坏，=gadgets.cardinal.no= =gadgets.pluralize:gadget was:gadgets were= 被砸碎，=furniture.cardinal.no= =furniture.pluralize:piece= 家具 =furniture.pluralize:was:were= 被毁坏。",
