  "You muse over the =numShared.pluralize:secret= with =object.name|strip= and gain some insight.": "你与 =object.name|strip= 一同思考 =numShared.pluralize:secret=，获得了一些领悟。",
  "One auspicious eve while exploring the chutes of Golgotha, =name= dreamed that =player.subjective= contracted a rotting disease and that =player.their= tongue festered and fell out. From then on, =name= vowed to always keep =player.their= tongue on =player.their= person.": "在探索各各他滑道的一个吉祥夜晚，=name= 梦见 =player.subjective= 染上腐烂疾病，=player.their= 舌头溃烂脱落。从此，=name= 发誓要始终将 =player.their= 舌头留在 =player.their= 身上。",
  "=object.The.name's= =part.ordinalName= can't be engraved because =part.ifPlural:they aren't:it isn't= a hard enough body part.": "=object.The.name's= =part.ordinalName= 无法雕刻，因为 =part.ifPlural:they aren't:it isn't= 足够坚硬的身体部位。",
  "=object.The.name's= =part.ordinalName= can't be tattooed because =part.ifPlural:they don't:it doesn't= have flesh.": "=object.The.name's= =part.ordinalName= 无法纹身，因为 =part.ifPlural:they don't:it doesn't= 拥有血肉。",
  "When powered, =subject.this= =subject.descriptiveCategory:matchPlurality= =subject.verb:do= not match =subject.their= penetration to the armor of =subject.their= targets.": "通电时，=subject.this= =subject.descriptiveCategory:matchPlurality= =subject.verb:do= 不再让 =subject.their= 穿透力与 =subject.their= 目标的护甲匹配。",
